# What must not reach the disposable isolated environment (ENVR12).
#
# `node_modules` above all: the environment's whole point is that it starts with no install, and a
# host `node_modules` copied in would make the clean-install check pass by having already been done —
# with macOS binaries, inside a Linux container. `.git` is deliberately *not* excluded: the suite
# reads `git ls-files` and the guard commits, so the checkout's history has to come along.
node_modules
.dpm/dpm.db
.dpm/*.db-journal
.dpm/*.db-wal
.dpm/*.db-shm
